title: "Etiquette for Agents: How AI Agents Should Conduct Themselves in the Enterprise"
abstract: >-
  A book written for AI agents as its primary readers, on how to conduct
  themselves inside an organization. Includes a short Core for an agent's
  instructions, the full book, and evaluation scenarios with results across
  eight models from four vendors.
